{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35285","headline":"送韩处士归少室山 · 张乔","name":"送韩处士归少室山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江外历千岑，还归少室吟。\n地闲缑岭月，窗迥洛城砧。\n石窦垂寒乳，松枝长别琴。\n他年瀑泉下，亦拟置家林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张乔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35285.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35285","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}